<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers steady to weak. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select and Choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 63.00-64.00, load Choice 64.50. Select 61.00-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 63.00-64.00, load 64.25. Select including Commerical individuals 60.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
